      ":question/id": "839952e8-22cc-5e4d-8fff-807571df2216",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/88/88bec66b7ece961f2f0fc4083ce317f2bdc414e0a219d61bbf9bf73ae667ca0f.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the left-opening parabola shown above.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "154041f6-7c1e-542c-9623-a8775606a3c6",
